<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Dungeon xp farm grind +eating (food in offhand)</Major>
    <Description>This macro will spam sweeping attacks in any dungeon xp farm and eat every 7 minutes. MAKE SURE TO PUT YOUR FOOD IN YOUR OFFHAND. Mending is recommended if you don't want to burn out your sword.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 800 ms
GoWhile 1 525
RightDown 1
Delay 4000 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 1500 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>